    "text": "A ring of the radius&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi></math> is suspended from a point on its circumference. If the ring is made to oscillate in the plane of the figure, then the angular frequency of these small oscillations is<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/EM0014076_Ques1_1.jpg\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 242px;\" />",
